      "description": "tasteskill 2.5.0, the anti-slop frontend skill. Builds professional company websites at the level of figma.com and x.ai: plain copy, one system, one section per screen, equal edges, real photographs and real product UI (product renders when there are no photographs), with shader effects, scenes and moments only on tech, gaming and software pages, quiet micro-interactions, and a checker that enforces it in a real browser. Use this whenever you build, design, redesign, restyle, polish or review a landing page, company, product, shop, cafe, hotel, studio, SaaS, AI, developer-tool or game site, in any stack (HTML/CSS, React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, Astro, Tailwind), or when the user says a page looks generic, templated or \"AI-made\".",
